    {
      "text": "Gu Immortals develop their immortal apertures and use the resources those apertures produce to cultivate, so the fertility of their soil plays a huge role. Prosperity soil can grow all sorts of flowers. Alongside diamond soil and green fist soil, it is a highly sought after item among Gu Immortals.",
