      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At Qin Bai Sheng’s open transactions, a seller offers broken wave flowers and asks for prosperity soil. Gu Immortals who own prosperity soil are not few, and they speak up at once to ask how much is needed for the trade. The seller trades a large stock of broken wave flowers for one thousand and five hundred kilograms of prosperity soil.",
